  "jei.ftbevolutioncompanion.pegasus.conversion": "Right click a tamed horse with this to give it wings and turn it into a pegasus. The horse carries the wings in its own slot, and you can also drop them straight into its armor slot. Combining horse armor with a pair of wings in an anvil makes Winged Horse Armor instead, which grants flight and keeps its protection.",
